What is the output of the following Java program?
```java
interface Measurable {
    double getArea();
    double getPerimeter();
}
abstract class EllipseBase implements Measurable {
    public double getPerimeter() { return 0.0; }
}
class CircleShape extends EllipseBase {
    private double r = 3.0;
    public double getArea() { return Math.PI * r * r;
    }
}
public class MeasureApp {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        Measurable m = new CircleShape();
        System.out.printf(java.util.Locale.US, "%.1f", m.getArea());
    }
}
```

